{"work_id": "MX5-066", "matched_key": "一九五七年夏季的形势", "normalized_offset": 50, "normalized_context": "话稿时加进去的2见司马迁报任少卿书3这段话引自毛泽东一九五七年七月在青岛召开的省市委书记会议期间写的一九五七年夏季的形势一文原文是我们的目标是想造成一个又有集中又有民主又有纪律又有自由又有统一意志又有个人心情舒畅生动活泼那样一种政治局面以利于社会主义革命和社会主义建设较易于克服困难较快地建设我国的现代工业和现代农业党和国家较为巩固较为能够经受风险4已经被推翻的反动阶级还企图复辟在社会主义社会还会产生新的资产阶级分子整个社会主义阶段存在着阶级和阶级斗争这种阶级斗争是长期的复杂的有时甚至是很激烈的这四句话是一九六二年九月二十八日党的八届十中全会公报中的提法一九六六年二月中共中央", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "book_title_marks", "witness_id": "A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E9%80%89%E9%9B%86.pdf", "raw_sha256": "e65195a022c0a066d8bbcf68fcf452a764f7f759019331cf153dadd16233d242", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-mirror-combined-unverified", "volume": null, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 1911, "end": 1911, "record_path": "archive/records/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-6f3c97f39a890c27616d.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "source_bytes_verified_imprint_images_available_for_review", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-bded09faa3b01fcb", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX5-066", "matched_key": "一九五七年夏季的形势", "normalized_offset": 37, "normalized_context": "1957年7月193的形势同日中共中央将这篇文章印发县一级党组织和干部阅读一九五七年夏季的形势一文指出在我国社会主义革命时期反共反人民反社会主义的资产阶级右派和人民的矛盾是敌我矛盾是对抗性的不可调和的你死我活的矛盾最后不能转变的那一部分资产阶级右派分子是死硬派只要他们不当特务不再进行破坏活动也给他们一点事做也不剥夺他们的公民权这是鉴于许多历史事件采取了极端政策的后果并不良好我们的目标是想造成一个又有集中又有民主又有纪律又有自由又有统一意志又有个人心情舒畅生动活泼那样一种政治局面以利于社会主义革命和社会主义建设较易于克服困难较快地建设我国的现代工业和", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "book_title_marks", "witness_id": "A-264a603d150bc5388914", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E5%B9%B4%E8%B0%B1/2023%E5%B9%B4%E7%89%88/%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E5%B9%B4%E8%B0%B1_%E7%AC%AC6%E5%8D%B7%EF%BC%881956.10-1959.03%EF%BC%89.pdf", "raw_sha256": "e92fe5099c1c865e951f472479118e4d2c3fa0056d6ef4f7738df4b564cd722c", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "nianpu-2023-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "kind": "pdf_page", "number": 198, "end": 198, "record_path": "archive/records/A-264a603d150bc5388914.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-264a603d150bc5388914.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东年谱_第6卷（1956.10-1959.03）", "source_media": "pdf", "source_layer": "digital_PDF_copy", "edition_verification_status": "source_bytes_verified_imprint_images_available_for_review", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "nianpu", "id": "C-cc77b09ea6f83c6d", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
